  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "An Englishman and an Irishman go to a bakery. The Englishman steals three buns and puts them into his pockets.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "vor",
      "text": "That took great skill and guile to steal those buns. The owner didn't even see me.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "That's just simple thievery. I'll show you how to do it the honest way and get the same results.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "Sir, I want to show you a magic trick.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The owner was intrigued, so he came over to see the magic trick.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The Irishman asked him for a bun and then he proceeded to eat it. He asked two more times, and after he ate them too, the owner said:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "character": "barmen",
      "text": "Okay my friend, where's the magic trick?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.7,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "Look in the Englishman's pockets.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": [],
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
